# The Rites of Life (CoP 1-1): 22's option 1 at the first zone-in. A level 75 Warrior of Bastok in Qufim Island warps
# into Lower Delkfutt's Tower ([COP]TalesBeginning 0): 22 left open, finished with 1: 36 (hidden), 37, 38, 39; 39's
# finish: the var is 0 (never set on this path): no enableEntities({}); begun, Mission[6][110]Status 1. Tales' Beginning
# then: current 110 is not below 110: no section 1 (its default).
warning: lua: addMission: overwriting current mission 101 of log 6 with 110 -- begin's addMission over the CoP log's fresh current 101 (Ancient Flames Beckon's category value; ZoneHost.Progress.cs logs it as C++ ShowWarning)
lists LowerDelkfuttsTower/onZoneIn/1 LowerDelkfuttsTower/onEventFinish/22 LowerDelkfuttsTower/onEventFinish/39 LowerDelkfuttsTower/Tales_Beginning/onTrigger
char zone=QufimIsland pos=-286.271,-21.619,320.084 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
login
warp 460.022,-1.77,-103.442 LowerDelkfuttsTower open  # from Qufim, the var 0: 22 left open
finish option=1                         # 1: 36 (hidden)
finish                                  # 37
finish                                  # 38
finish                                  # 39
finish                                  # the var 0: no enableEntities({}); begun, Status 1
trigger Tales_Beginning                 # current 110: no section 1
finish-if-event
